#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_approval.field_approval_rule__self_approve
msgid "The steps the requester is an approver of are approved as they ask, e.g. a sales manager confirming their own order. Otherwise somebody else approves them."
msgstr "申请人同时也是审批人的步骤在其发起时即被批准，例如销售经理确认自己的订单。否则由他人批准。"

